menu "RoboHub DHT11 module"

config RH_BOARD_DHT11_MODULE
    bool "DHT11 temperature and humidity sensor breakout"
    select RH_DRV_DHT11
    default n
    help
      The DHT11 temperature and humidity sensor breakout. Selecting it brings in
      the driver and the single-wire line and timer the breakout needs; an
      application that does not fit the module pays for none of it.

endmenu
